ROONA HAMARI JAAN HAI MATAM HAMARI SHAAN HAI SHEH KI AZA PEHCHAN HAI TA HASHR HUM DENGE SADA KARBOBALA KARBOBALA<br>
DIL ME RAHE KARBO-BALA AJRE RISALAT HO ADA DIL ME RAHE KARBOBALA<br>
<br>
1. AKBER KE GHAM SE HAI JAWA'N IS ANJUMAN KA KARWA'N HUM AAJ HAI JOH KAMRA'N ZEHRA KI HUMKO HAI DUA<br>
DIL ME RAHE KARBOBALA<br>
<br>
2. KARBAL KI AISI HAI ZAMEEN QAM AMBIYA KI HAI JABEEN ROOH E IBADAT HAI YAHI CHEHRE PE DEEN KE HAI LIKHA<br>
<br>
DIL ME RAHE KARBOBALA<br>
<br>
3. UN PER SITAM KYUN KER HAI YEH SARKAR KE DILBAR HAI YEH QURAN KE PAIKER HAI YEH<br>
HAI DEEN KO INSE AASRAA DIL ME RAHE KARBOBALA<br>
4. HAI ROOH KI YEH BANDAGI SHEH KI AZA HAI ZINDAGI<br>
<br>
KARTE RAHINGE HAR GHADI MATAM ALI KE LAAL KA<br>
<br>
DIL ME RAHE KARBOBALA<br>
<br>
5. ZALIM NA KAR USPER JAFA NOOR E NAZAR HAI YEH MERA BINTE NABI KI THI SADA<br>
PHIR BHI SITAM HAR EK HUWA DIL ME RAHE KARBOBALA<br>
6. ABBAS KE PARCHAM TAALE DIL KO SUKOON MILTA RAHE AHLE AZA KE QAFELE JAATEY RAHINGE KARBALA<br>
<br>
DIL ME RAHE KARBOBALA<br>
<br>
7. DEEN E NABI KI ZINDAGI ASGHER KE JHOOLEY ME PAALI SAARE JAHAN KI ROUSHNI ALBER KE QHADMOU KI ZIYA<br>
<br>
DIL ME RAHE KARBOBALA<br>
<br>
8. SHABBER KA HAI JOH NAZNEEN AISA NAHI DULHA KAHI<br>
ZAQMOU SE ROUSN HAI JABEEN PAMAAL HAI SUB DASTO PAA<br>
<br>
DIL ME RAHE KARBOBALA<br>
<br>
9. AOUN O MOHD KI WEGA KEHTI THI JANG E KARBALA YAAD AAYI HYDER KI ADA ABBAS KA WOH HOUSLA<br>
<br>
DIL ME RAHE KARBOBALA<br>
<br>
10. HAATOH PE SHEH KE BEZUBAN YUN HOUSLA LEKER JAWAN HASKER DIYA HAI IMTEHAN HAR SO SITAM ROTA RAHA<br>
<br>
DIL ME RAHE KARBOBALA<br>
<br>
11. ISLAM KI JOH AAN HAI SHABBIR KA AHSAAN HAI BAQI HAMARI SHAAN HAI KEHTE HAI KHUD YEH AMBIYA<br>
<br>
DIL ME RAHE KARBOBALA<br>
<br>
12. AHLE WAFA KI JAAN HAI IMAAN KI PEHCHAN HAI HAQ PER WOH INSAAN HAI JO GHAM MANAYE SHAH KA<br>
<br>
DIL ME RAHE KARBOBALA<br>
<br>
13. BINTE ALI KE LAAL KA LIKHTE RAHO NOUHA FIDA AUR DAM NIKAL JAYE MERA BAS YEH KHUDA SE HAI DUA<br>
<br>
DIL ME RAHE KARBOBALA<br>
AZZ ALAMDAR FIDA<br>
